## State Migration (Zero-Diff)

To move existing resources from dev/prod suffix pattern to the for_each module **without destroying and recreating**:

### Step 1: List Current State

```bash
terraform state list
```

Example output:
```
aws_eks_cluster.dev
aws_eks_cluster.prod
aws_eks_node_group.dev
aws_eks_node_group.prod
aws_s3_bucket.assets_dev
aws_s3_bucket.assets_prod
aws_rds_cluster.db_dev
aws_rds_cluster.db_prod
# ... etc
```

### Step 2: Create State Migration Script

**`migrate-state.sh`**

```bash
#!/bin/bash
set -e

# Define migrations: old_address -> new_address
declare -a MIGRATIONS=(
  "aws_eks_cluster.dev -> module.environment[\"dev\"].aws_eks_cluster.main"
  "aws_eks_cluster.prod -> module.environment[\"prod\"].aws_eks_cluster.main"
  "aws_eks_node_group.dev -> module.environment[\"dev\"].aws_eks_node_group.main"
  "aws_eks_node_group.prod -> module.environment[\"prod\"].aws_eks_node_group.main"
  "aws_iam_role.eks_dev -> module.environment[\"dev\"].aws_iam_role.eks"
  "aws_iam_role.eks_prod -> module.environment[\"prod\"].aws_iam_role.eks"
  "aws_iam_role.nodes_dev -> module.environment[\"dev\"].aws_iam_role.nodes"
  "aws_iam_role.nodes_prod -> module.environment[\"prod\"].aws_iam_role.nodes"
  "aws_iam_role_policy_attachment.eks_cluster_policy_dev -> module.environment[\"dev\"].aws_iam_role_policy_attachment.eks_cluster_policy"
  "aws_iam_role_policy_attachment.eks_cluster_policy_prod -> module.environment[\"prod\"].aws_iam_role_policy_attachment.eks_cluster_policy"
  "aws_iam_role_policy_attachment.node_policy_dev -> module.environment[\"dev\"].aws_iam_role_policy_attachment.node_policy"
  "aws_iam_role_policy_attachment.node_policy_prod -> module.environment[\"prod\"].aws_iam_role_policy_attachment.node_policy"
  "aws_iam_role_policy_attachment.node_cni_policy_dev -> module.environment[\"dev\"].aws_iam_role_policy_attachment.node_cni_policy"
  "aws_iam_role_policy_attachment.node_cni_policy_prod -> module.environment[\"prod\"].aws_iam_role_policy_attachment.node_cni_policy"
  "aws_s3_bucket.assets_dev -> module.environment[\"dev\"].aws_s3_bucket.assets"
  "aws_s3_bucket.assets_prod -> module.environment[\"prod\"].aws_s3_bucket.assets"
  "aws_s3_bucket_versioning.assets_dev -> module.environment[\"dev\"].aws_s3_bucket_versioning.assets"
  "aws_s3_bucket_versioning.assets_prod -> module.environment[\"prod\"].aws_s3_bucket_versioning.assets"
  "aws_s3_bucket_server_side_encryption_configuration.assets_dev -> module.environment[\"dev\"].aws_s3_bucket_server_side_encryption_configuration.assets"
  "aws_s3_bucket_server_side_encryption_configuration.assets_prod -> module.environment[\"prod\"].aws_s3_bucket_server_side_encryption_configuration.assets"
  "aws_s3_bucket_public_access_block.assets_dev -> module.environment[\"dev\"].aws_s3_bucket_public_access_block.assets"
  "aws_s3_bucket_public_access_block.assets_prod -> module.environment[\"prod\"].aws_s3_bucket_public_access_block.assets"
