## Key Benefits

| Aspect | Before | After |
|--------|--------|-------|
| **Code Duplication** | ~1500 LOC (dev + prod blocks) | ~600 LOC (single module) |
| **Scaling New Envs** | Copy entire blocks | Add one line to locals map |
| **Consistency** | Manual alignment required | Guaranteed by module |
| **State Management** | Separate dev/prod concerns | Unified via for_each |
| **Configuration Drift** | High (manual sync) | Low (single source) |

