## Acceptance Criteria Satisfaction

✅ **Bucket**: Versioning, AES-256 encryption, no public access (via `aws_s3_bucket_public_access_block`)  
✅ **RDS**: Deletion protection, 7-day retention, not publicly accessible, encrypted  
✅ **Secret**: Stored in AWS Secrets Manager (never in Git)  
✅ **IAM**: Least privilege per env (prod stricter than dev), no wildcards in prod policy  
✅ **Cluster**: Managed node groups, env-specific instance types & replicas  
✅ **HTTPS**: ALB listener on 443, cert referenced, no forced redirects  
✅ **Environment Isolation**: `for_each` maps isolate dev/prod independently; changing one does not affect the other's state
